## 2. データモデル設計

### 2.1 Firestore コレクション構造

```mermaid
erDiagram
    users ||--o{ tierLists : creates
    users ||--o{ comments : writes
    users ||--o{ likes : gives
    users ||--o{ follows : "follows/followed"
    tierLists ||--o{ comments : has
    tierLists ||--o{ likes : receives
    tierLists }|--|| categories : belongsTo
    tierLists ||--o{ tierItems : contains
    categories ||--o{ masterItems : has
    tierItems }o--o| masterItems : references

    users {
        string id PK
        string email
        string displayName
        string photoURL
        string bio
        int followersCount
        int followingCount
        int tierListsCount
        timestamp createdAt
        timestamp updatedAt
    }

    tierLists {
        string id PK
        string userId FK
        string categoryId FK
        string title
        string description
        map tiers
        boolean isPublic
        int likesCount
        int commentsCount
        int viewsCount
        timestamp createdAt
        timestamp updatedAt
    }

    tierItems {
        string id PK
        string tierListId FK
        string masterItemId FK
        string tier
        int order
        string customLabel
        string customImageUrl
    }

    categories {
        string id PK
        string name
        string description
        string iconUrl
        int tierListsCount
